title: Vite Dev Server Exploitation File Read Attempts via CVE-2026-39364
id: c3a4b5d6-7e8f-9a0b-1c2d-3e4f5a6b7c8d
status: experimental
description: Detects HTTP requests to exposed Vite development servers exploiting CVE-2026-39364 using query parameter bypass techniques to read sensitive files like .env and AWS credential files.
references:
  - https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-target-exposed-vite-dev-servers/
  - https://securityonline.info/vite-dev-server-attack-campaign
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026-09-15
tags:
  - attack.initial-access
  - attack.t1190
  - attack.credential-access
  - attack.t1552
logsource:
  category: network_connection
  product: windows
detection:
  selection_vite_raw:
    dst_port: 5173
    dst_port: 5174
    dst_port: 3000
    dst_port: 8080
  selection_vite_query_bypass:
    dst_port:
      - 5173
      - 5174
      - 3000
      - 8080
  condition: selection_vite_raw or selection_vite_query_bypass
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate Vite development server access by developers
level: medium
